  <name>ParrotIA</name>
  <summary>Transcribe audio and video locally</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Turn recordings into text and subtitles with Whisper speech recognition.
    ParrotIA processes audio on your computer and offers both a desktop
    interface and a command-line tool.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Transcribe multiple files and detect the spoken language</li>
      <li>Export text, Markdown, SRT, WebVTT and JSON</li>
      <li>Choose a speech model to balance speed and accuracy</li>
    </ul>
    <p>An internet connection is needed to download a speech model on first use.
    Cached models can then be used offline. Audio recordings are processed
    locally.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.igorbispo99.ParrotIA.desktop</launchable>
